<%= scope(:popover_default_content, name: :mac_address, label: "MAC Address").render do %>
  <p>Uniquely identifies your device when communicating over the network. The MAC address of your device is automatically obtained for you after adding this server's URI via your device's Capitive WiFi Portal.</p>

  <p>If creating a virtual device, a locally administered, unicast, address is auto-generated for you which consists of six segments, capitalized, and only using hexadecimal characters. Example: <code>02:A1:B2:C3:D4:E5</code>. For physical devices, please use the MAC address of your device in order to connect properly.</p>
<% end %>
